## Guest workspace runtime (P5.3.a)

`@app-tour/guest-workspace-runtime` owns portal/marketing **product** dynamic registrars and guest theme loaders. Codegen writes:

- `packages/guest-workspace-runtime/src/register-*.generated.ts`
- `workspace-plugin-register-manifest.generated.ts`
- `workspace-guest-theme-stylesheets.{portal,marketing}.generated.ts`

Apps import `@app-tour/guest-workspace-runtime` (portal) / themes + marketing-catalog (marketing). **P5.3.b:** marketing no longer declares product workspace packages — catalog bindings and `MarketingCatalogSurface` types live in the runtime package.

## Manifest boundary allowlist (P5.2 / P5.2.b / P5.4)

Codegen emits `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/generated/manifest-boundary-allowlist.generated.cjs` so workspace membership is not hand-copied into architecture guards.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  M["workspace.manifest.json"] --> G["generateManifestBoundaryAllowlist"]
  G --> F["manifest-boundary-allowlist.generated.cjs"]
  F --> W["dependency-cruiser web rules"]
  F --> A["dependency-cruiser API rules"]
  F --> C["guard-guest-consumer-deps"]
  F --> B["guard-generated-banner"]
  F --> S["guard-guest-frozen-shell"]
```

| Export | Meaning |
| ------ | ------- |
| `PRODUCT_WORKSPACE_*` | Trunk plugins (excludes finance/booking `registryOnly`) |
| `ALL_WORKSPACE_*` | Every discovered manifest (API allowlist + frozen-shell forbid list) |
| `DEPCRUISE_WEB_*` / `DEPCRUISE_API_*` | Regex alternations consumed by `dependency-cruiser.config.js` |
| `PORTAL_REGISTER_GENERATED_RELS` | Portal `register-*.generated.ts` paths |

**TEMP-P0:** hand-synced finance-ws entries in depcruise are **closed** — regenerated from manifests. Remaining API `HOST_IMPORT_LEGACY_ALLOWLIST` is a permanent shrink-ratchet, not a TEMP ticket. Guest product-dep collapse remains **P5.3** (`guest-workspace-runtime`, Architect YES).

