## G4 — member portal fold (2026-07-07)

Moved `scripts/member-portal-contract-codegen.mjs` into `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/domains/member-portal.mjs`. The sibling path becomes a **re-export shim** so guards and external imports keep working.

| Export | Role |
| ------ | ---- |
| `MEMBER_PORTAL_*` constants | nav tiers, reserved ids, preset catalog |
| `normalizeMemberPortalAvailability`, `resolveEffectiveMemberPortalConfig` | manifest → effective config |
| `assertMemberPortalManifest`, `assertMemberPortalL4ReferenceWorkspaces` | pre-emit gates (orchestrator) |
| `generateWorkspaceMemberPortalContracts`, `generateWorkspaceMemberPortalSurfaces` | `member` domain outputs |

**Non-goal (G4):** removing `MEMBER_PORTAL_PRESETS` — presets remain generic (`guest-minimal-v1`, `guest-full-v1`); workspace-id branching stays forbidden (`guard-no-workspace-ids-in-codegen` scans `domains/member-portal.mjs`).

